WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.620
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to Final Nights 3.

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.120
*Beep*

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:07.940
Hey! Hi! What do I do? I don't know what to do... Oh god...

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.800
What are you doing outside my window?

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.880
*ominous noise*

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:12.580
Hi...!

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.040
How's it going?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.680
I'm just gonna stare death in the face 'cause I got no other alternative!!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.500
Boy, you got a lovely smile!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.380
*ominous laughter*

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:21.680
Eugh, that ain't good.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.440
*Shrieks in panic* Fuck off!

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.280
I'm dead. I don't know how to play! *laughs*

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:27.780
*Beep*

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.320
Oh, what??

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.940
What am I doing? What am I doing?!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.220
I don't know what's happening..

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.900
That's one intimidating c*l*ock right there...

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.740
A great big c*l*ock!

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:38.780
Come in a- *moaning noise from monster*

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.520
That ain't a good sound. I can't do anything!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.260
*Keyboard clicks* I'm pressing buttons!

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.640
AHHH! I got my defenses at maximum!

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.180
*Smack*

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.040
Maximum efficiency!

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:50.760
*Clock chimes*

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:51.960
Wooo!!!

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.640
I did something!

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.600
*sobbing* I don't know what I did!

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.100
*Beep*

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.200
*Rumble of thunder*
Ehhh...

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.200
Hello. BOO!

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.660
*Thunderclap*
Ahh! Fuck you! *laughs* What the fuck?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:04.660
Why did I go confront him?!

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:05.160
*Beep*

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.860
Floof the hair! FOR POWER! *explosion*

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:08.360
*Beep*

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.560
I really am expecting something to pop out, but apparently nothing wants to say hi to me.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.320
I must be so adorable when I sleep.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.680
*Grandfather clock chiming*
I win! Again.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.220
Whaa-a-at?

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:21.600
AHHH!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.360
Okay, alright, I guess I'm dead.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:24.860
*Beep*

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.540
