Hi! What are you doing outside my window?

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.080
Are you cleep-clreepy-cllll-creep-creepering in?

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.380
[Second video]
We were just having a bromance and you-

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.440
You made it all weird, CHAD!

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:39.580
[Third video]
Certainly not gonna shove this fork into this power plug. *giggles*

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.040
Here baby, baby, baby.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.880
That's one intimating clock right there..

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:46.200
A great big

